          "description": "An entertaining and engaging way for children to learn and practise their times tables. In line with current curriculum guidelines, all tables from 1-12 are covered in the order they are taught in school.\n\nAmusing and catchy songs in a range of musical styles help to make learning times tables enjoyable and fun. Ladybird Times Tables Audio Collection: I'm Ready for Maths features compositions by Dan Martin and Richard Hughes and lyrics by Tim Kennington and Richard Hughes. It is read by Isabel Adomakoh-Young, Kristin Atherton, Tim Kennington and Richard Hughes.",
